ألة الزواج، وبين عمه الثري الذي يعتبرها محبوبته ولكنه لا يقرر الزواج منها أيضًا، ولكن حياة نور وعاداتها وتقاليدها الصعيدية تفرض عليها الزواج وعدم الدخول في علاقات عاطفية فقط دون زواج، تقابل نور مطربًا (وحيد) وتقع في غرامه.","description_en":"The events of the film revolve around the singer (Nour) and her great confusion between (Samir), who loves her with all his heart but does not propose marriage to her, and his rich uncle, who considers her his lover but does not decide to marry her either, but Nour’s life and her Upper Egypt customs and traditions force her to marry and not enter into marriage. In only romantic relationships without marriage, Nour meets a (lonely) singer and falls in love with him.","description_fr":"","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rKtNifSxPUhYxFuEawVDvbnEUs7.jpg","backdrop":null,"has_poster":true,"rating":null,"vote_count":null,"age_rating":null,"year":"1952","release_date":"1952-08-08","runtime_minutes":122,"status":"Released","country":"مصر","language":"العربية","genres":["دراما","رومنسية"],"genre_keys":["drama","romance"],"similar":["mv194","mv271954","mv603661","mv9390","mv330493","mv25196","mv85922","mv287872"],"director":"أحمد بدرخان","cast":[{"name":"نور الهدى","character":"Farhana / Nour Al-Ain","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/kyEFtgJ8ES7jnJgZWuuGnr1rzGH.jpg"},{"name":"فريد الأطرش","character":"Farid / Ali","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/3M2dhjmPucvJyLwwT2GEct5Ukr1.jpg"},{"name":"سليمان نجيب","character":"Wagdy Bey Crystal","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/9IMr3lwYp0aywne10APW79knkSK.jpg"},{"name":"عبدالسلام النابلسي","character":"Wagih Bey Crystal","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4K4UJ5dUgIykYAu4uYCfSJZavVP.jpg"},{"name":"زينات صدقي","character":"Fakiha","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lV5fIfqK2Pzz2sFWv1rSpMVrwx9.jpg"},{"name":"سراج منير","character":"Taher Pasha Al-Anfoushi","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/aMBKeRxBOItWY9qa